    "narrative": "The Zurich Zebras enter today\u2019s slate with a lineup heavily incentivized by stolen base upside and favorable SP_xERA matchups. **Pete Crow-Armstrong** (80.98) and **Christian Yelich** (75.84) represent our two strongest plays, both buoyed by high-order positioning and significant platoon advantages against Phillips and Singer, respectively. **Pete Crow-Armstrong** is particularly well-positioned as a leadoff catalyst, with his 14% dynamic platoon boost and 10% order bonus making him the engine of today's offensive floor. Meanwhile, **Yordan Alvarez** (68.04) remains an elite volume play despite a platoon disadvantage, as his xwOBA of 0.450 outweighs the inherent risk of facing a left-handed arm in Rodriguez.\n\nThe most difficult decision on the morning involved **Colt Keith**, who finished with a 45.59 score. While he cleared our \"Below Floor\" threshold, he was ultimately benched in favor of higher-efficiency alternatives due to the difficult matchup against G. Williams (2.89 xERA). The optimizer favored the higher park factors and platoon splits provided by the likes of **Josh Smith** (60.34) and **Caleb Durbin** (65.89). **Caleb Durbin** remains a crucial \"hold\" asset given his 42% SB efficiency, helping us chip away at the category scarcity despite facing a relatively tough matchup against Bradish. We are also monitoring **Chase Meidroth** closely; currently penciled into the #7 spot, his lineup status remains pending, and his 50.76 score is contingent on him securing those plate appearances against the challenging Bailey Ober.\n\nManagement remains cautious regarding **Christian Encarnacion-Strand** (55.66), whose production is heavily tethered to the 16% park boost against Tolle, and **Junior Caminero** (59.63), who faces a stiff test against Gore. These plays hover near our \"Marginal\" threshold, requiring diligent monitoring for in-game adjustments. With **Gary Sanchez** unavailable and **Carson Benge** falling well below our 40.0 floor, we are betting on our starting nine to maximize the current favorable weather and favorable SP_xERA environments to keep pace in the rotisserie standings.",
